Copy the chosen checkpoint's contents directly into this checkpoints/model/
directory (not a subdirectory) before `docker build`:

  model.pt
  config.json
  training_args.json
  stats_data.json
  processor/...

These are exactly what a training run directory already contains (see
origami_trex/T-Rex/scripts/train_origami.sh's OUTPUT_DIR). Delete this file
once the real checkpoint is in place -- entrypoint.sh checks for the five
items above, not for this placeholder.
